    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăcor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		aceo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				sour taste</i>, <i>sourness.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Col. 3, 21,
				5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 8,
			1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 41, 96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">18, 11, 26</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of meat,</span>”
